{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;Climb using only your golf club in this physics based challenge.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Swing, launch, and scale through unique environments where every shot can take you higher or send you straight to the bottom&quot;.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore unique environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441670/extras/b3fd40795ba93b85988f7686223550c8.poster.avif?t=1770898085\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441670/extras/b3fd40795ba93b85988f7686223550c8.webm?t=1770898085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Be carefull that you dont fall</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441670/extras/63811225cadc39e785020579507ef500.poster.avif?t=1770898085\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441670/extras/63811225cadc39e785020579507ef500.webm?t=1770898085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find different golf clubs in shrines</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441670/extras/e3e16a7d5b8c10b2115a6e5bb37881de.poster.avif?t=1770898085\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441670/extras/e3e16a7d5b8c10b2115a6e5bb37881de.webm?t=1770898085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Collect Geo to master the arts of golf</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441670/extras/b07cd45e0d948b22cf27b55a24e09de6.poster.avif?t=1770898085\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441670/extras/b07cd45e0d948b22cf27b55a24e09de6.webm?t=1770898085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NotFunGolf is a brutally funny, physics-based climbing game where you play as a golf ball on an impossible journey up a massive mountain.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Collect Geo and find Shrines to maximize the golfing experience, each golfclub has a unique twist and amount of hits!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Swing, bounce, and rage your way through diverse themed environments, Every shot counts, and every mistake can send you tumbling back down.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Use different clubs strategically to overcome tricky terrain, uncover Geo rocks, and solve light environmental puzzles. Earn Geo's, unlock new clubs, and try to keep your cool as the narrator mockingly celebrates your failures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Can you stay on the course... or will you lose it first?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Climb through multiple Acts, each with its own unique visuals, physics, and mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Bramblewood with sticking thorn walls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The mines with physics objects</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Radiant caverns with rolling boulders</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Winterbound with lower gravity and falling pinecones</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to NOTFUNGOLF!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Finish the ascent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3441670/08eba65fa3d004a2fb80bd6865079c71f4faad9c.jpg"},{"name":"Less than 30 minutes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3441670/e5e1bd60fa3e8cfddbd880141ad1bc76034d547d.jpg"},{"name":"Club Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3441670/ac7b1e70ce5c41c529624d83cbf1f2c8ea8ed48c.jpg"},{"name":"Get cautious","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3441670/7e02b06e5e0f0315697978c4612e1c07dfa076a2.jpg"},{"name":"BrambleWood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3441670/57d45ab9834318bbf0fcf0f540eeea01ca0a2601.jpg"},{"name":"Deadmans Bay","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3441670/79b81527de2a04e956ce5f00a10f5a77d6505c3f.jpg"},{"name":"Mineshafts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3441670/824c4db2de5df040c97bb4c42ae004a1acb226a3.jpg"},{"name":"Radiant Caverns","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3441670/5f19abe46cd6f56925bd4ac07f28118f54bd8ece.jpg"},{"nam